# Label typography

Typography for `Label` (`@/components/Primitives/Label/Label`) comes **only** from `variant` (`EVariantLabel` → `frontend/src/theme/typography.ts`).

Never override with `text-*` size, `font-*` weight, `leading-*`, or `tracking-*` on `Label`.

## Pick variant by context

| Context | Variant |
| --- | --- |
| Marketing hero / page title | `h1`–`h3` |
| Auth / form page title | `h3` (not `h1`) |
| Section title (home, about, list page) | `h2`–`h4` |
| Card / list / modal / form section title | `h5`–`h6` |
| Stat / price visual anchor | `h5`–`h6` |
| Paragraph / main readable copy | `body` or `bodyLarge` |
| Secondary line, nav link, button text, form field label | `bodySmall` |
| Section eyebrow (uppercase meta above a title) | `overline` |
| Date, badge chip, timestamp, tiny meta | `caption` |
| Form hint / error / field key in detail rows | `hint` |

## Do

```tsx
import Label from '@/components/Primitives/Label/Label'
import { EVariantLabel } from '@/Enum/Enum'

<Label variant={EVariantLabel.h3} color="text-gray-900">{t('title')}</Label>
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.overline} color="text-gold-600" className="uppercase">
  {t('eyebrow')}
</Label>
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.h6} color="text-gray-900">{item.title}</Label>
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.caption} color="text-gray-500">{date}</Label>
```

## Don't

```tsx
{/* ❌ Hero size on a card or auth form */}
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.h1}>{cardName}</Label>

{/* ❌ Paragraph variant on a section title */}
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.bodyLarge}>{sectionTitle}</Label>

{/* ❌ Size/weight utilities on Label */}
<Label variant={EVariantLabel.h3} className="text-2xl font-bold">Title</Label>

{/* ❌ Raw HTML for user-facing copy */}
<p className="text-sm">{t('title')}</p>
```

## Allowed on `className`

Layout / clamp only: `mt-2`, `mb-4`, `block`, `truncate`, `line-clamp-2`, `text-center`, `uppercase` (eyebrows).

If weight or size looks wrong, change the token in `typography.ts` or pick another variant — do not patch with Tailwind type utilities.
